  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 22 01 09 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}恭候多时了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}那么，马上开始比试。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}这么快！{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}正合我意{F5 47 02 01 01 01 03 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}我一直期待着这一刻。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}让您变得更强，\n再由您召唤{F2 01 03 01}“那个人格面具”{F2 01 01 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}这正是“研究”的目的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}……不过，我也纯粹地\n期待着与您交手。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}当我倾尽全力时，\n仿佛就能找到一直寻求的“答案”……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:4:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_0023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}不，哪怕只是窥见\n那份“答案”的一角……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:4:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_0023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}我有这样的预感。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}什么意思？{F5 47 02 01 01 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}不太明白{F5 47 02 01 01 01 05 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}……失礼了。\n现在，\n我能说的只有一句话。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}那就是……\n请战胜我。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞从伊丽莎白身上，\n　感受到了沉静的斗志……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 09 01 02 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}看来果然只能一战了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0B 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}队长，可别大意。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}这次可不会像前两次一样。\n请抱着杀死我的决心来吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e823_330.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}抽卡。人格面具卡。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
